{"id":"n31751-3-8","stage":4,"title":"정비 · 维护","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31751-3-8-1","ko":"오늘은 왜 차를 안 가지고 가?","zh":"今天怎么不带车去？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차를","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"表示前面提到的行动或状态成为后面内容的原因、手段或理由。","explanation":"가지다：表示前面提到的行动或状态成为后面内容的原因、手段或理由。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61191","senseId":"2","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가?","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"表示前面提到的行动或状态成为后面内容的原因、手段或理由。","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"61191","definition":"表示前面提到的行动或状态成为后面内容的原因、手段或理由。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"船、飞机、汽车等去往某个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a9dc9fea2fc029cf93d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31751-3-8-2","ko":"회사 건물에 있는 주차장이 정비 중이거든.","zh":"公司大楼的停车场正在整修。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건물에","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주차장이","meaning":"停车场","explanation":"주차장：停车场；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주차장","audio":"/audio/ae63f424005e52be69b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91772","senseId":"1","lemma":"주차장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정비","meaning":"维护","explanation":"정비：维护","readings":[{"term":"정비","audio":"/audio/5ac0e2da531dcfd538c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31751","senseId":"3","lemma":"정비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중이거든.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"将要完成或进行某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ae63f424005e52be","term":"주차장","zh":"停车场","audio":"/audio/ae63f424005e52be69b9.mp3","entryId":"91772","definition":"供停放车辆使用的场地。","pronunciation":["주ː차장"]},{"id":"5ac0e2da531dcfd5","term":"정비","zh":"维护","audio":"/audio/5ac0e2da531dcfd538c8.mp3","entryId":"31751","definition":"修缮道路或设施等使正常发挥功能。","pronunciation":["정ː비"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]}],"audio":"/audio/430b351e825f5ca69b8e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.457,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31751","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.1823,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["公司大楼的停车场正在整修。","今天怎么不带车去？","外面有谁来了吗？我听到敲门声了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天怎么不带车去？","外面有谁来了吗？我听到敲门声了。","公司大楼的停车场正在整修。"],"answer":2}]}
